WEBVTT

01:40.180 --> 01:44.800
=Love Story in the 1970s=

01:45.100 --> 01:47.940
=Episode 11=

01:50.648 --> 01:52.110
You two are not sleeping together?

01:53.940 --> 01:54.980
Of course we are.

01:56.250 --> 01:57.580
Then, what's with the bunk bed?

01:57.580 --> 01:59.010
We sleep on the bottom,

01:59.010 --> 02:00.420
and use the top for storage.

02:00.420 --> 02:01.170
It's practical.

02:01.600 --> 02:02.980
- Storage?
- Yeah, storage.

02:03.426 --> 02:04.460
There's a lot of stuff.

02:04.510 --> 02:05.340
See?

02:09.340 --> 02:10.740
Well, that's new.

02:12.530 --> 02:13.780
Honestly,

02:13.850 --> 02:15.020
regular beds are expensive.

02:15.020 --> 02:16.180
We can't afford one.

02:16.250 --> 02:17.860
So we went with this.

02:17.860 --> 02:19.570
No one wanted it, so we grabbed it.

02:20.740 --> 02:21.620
It's nice. Really.

02:21.850 --> 02:23.900
Well, we're neighbors now,

02:23.900 --> 02:24.760
so we'll be

02:24.760 --> 02:25.690
seeing each other.

02:25.940 --> 02:26.850
I won't keep you.

02:26.850 --> 02:27.530
I'll get going.

02:27.530 --> 02:28.590
- I'll walk you out.
- No need.

02:28.604 --> 02:29.620
You stay. I'll head off.

02:29.940 --> 02:30.900
- Alright.
- Bye.

02:37.460 --> 02:38.620
That was close.

02:38.620 --> 02:39.570
Way too close.

02:40.690 --> 02:41.950
She kind of had a point, though.

02:42.340 --> 02:43.530
Maybe we could squeeze in

02:43.530 --> 02:44.671
and use the top for storage.

02:44.680 --> 02:46.530
In your dreams. Get cleaning.

02:49.180 --> 02:51.500
(Jiangnan Municipal People's Hospital)

02:51.500 --> 02:53.760
(Doctors' Office)

02:53.760 --> 02:54.410
Qu,

02:54.880 --> 02:56.790
let's grab some lunch.

02:57.650 --> 02:58.650
I'll pass. You go ahead.

03:00.220 --> 03:01.690
Your wife brings you meals anyway.

03:02.940 --> 03:03.740
All right.

03:04.020 --> 03:05.810
I'll head out first, then.

03:08.620 --> 03:09.460
Dr. Qu,

03:10.340 --> 03:11.180
your lunch.

03:12.570 --> 03:13.460
Where's Fang Mujing?

03:14.300 --> 03:14.920
Ms. Fang?

03:14.920 --> 03:15.940
She's at school.

03:15.940 --> 03:17.500
She said from now on, I'll bring

03:17.500 --> 03:18.430
your meals and clothes.

03:21.460 --> 03:22.960
All right. I'll get going.

03:46.500 --> 03:47.280
You're back.

03:52.471 --> 03:53.937
Why didn't you go to the hospital?

03:56.620 --> 03:57.460
I did for a week

03:57.810 --> 03:59.550
to fulfill my duties as a wife.

04:00.340 --> 04:01.020
I'm done.

04:01.440 --> 04:02.900
I have my own work.

04:04.900 --> 04:06.120
You just wanted to prove

04:06.715 --> 04:08.226
you're prettier than the others.

04:09.300 --> 04:10.990
I want to prove a math theorem.

05:06.370 --> 05:07.690
You don't love me at all.

05:08.890 --> 05:10.060
Do you love me?

05:14.060 --> 05:15.300
Is it that you can't answer

05:16.210 --> 05:17.570
or you won't?

05:19.450 --> 05:20.810
I just won't tell a lie

05:21.420 --> 05:23.130
that's exposed
the moment it's questioned.

05:26.026 --> 05:27.660
You won't lower yourself to love me.

05:27.660 --> 05:28.450
I understand.

05:29.010 --> 05:31.010
But don't expect me
to fawn over you either.

05:31.540 --> 05:32.770
I hope you understand that.

05:34.220 --> 05:35.190
Love takes time for me.

05:35.190 --> 05:36.060
For me too.

05:39.300 --> 05:40.450
If there's nothing else,

05:41.370 --> 05:43.300
I'd like to finish writing that proof.

06:25.980 --> 06:28.140
(Jiangcheng)

06:34.620 --> 06:35.060
Ni.

06:35.540 --> 06:36.100
Hey, Brother.

06:36.182 --> 06:36.940
Thanks for coming.

06:36.960 --> 06:38.010
- It's nothing.
- I've got it.

06:38.010 --> 06:38.540
Fang Muyang,

06:38.740 --> 06:40.370
take my luggage home first.

06:40.660 --> 06:42.100
I need to run an errand.

06:42.740 --> 06:43.500
What errand?

06:45.300 --> 06:46.250
I'm going to Lin Mei's.

06:48.770 --> 06:50.370
You really are her brother.

06:50.760 --> 06:52.010
I was thinking the same thing.

06:52.060 --> 06:53.570
I was thinking we'd go to Lin Mei's

06:53.570 --> 06:55.180
and propose when you've arrived.

06:55.500 --> 06:56.500
That won't do.

06:56.690 --> 06:58.370
I can't let you tag along to a proposal.

06:59.060 --> 07:00.100
Why not?

07:00.100 --> 07:02.300
You know what her parents are like.

07:02.300 --> 07:03.890
If Mom and Dad go, it'll end in a fight.

07:03.890 --> 07:05.180
I'm the perfect choice.

07:05.180 --> 07:06.130
I'm a girl,

07:06.130 --> 07:07.620
and I'm Lin Mei's best friend.

07:07.660 --> 07:10.100
They won't say anything harsh to me.

07:10.100 --> 07:11.570
I've talked it through with Lin Mei.

07:11.570 --> 07:12.450
Let's go.

07:13.540 --> 07:14.130
Wait.

07:15.570 --> 07:16.210
Bring these.

07:16.210 --> 07:17.420
I picked these for her parents.

07:17.420 --> 07:17.810
Come on.

07:18.210 --> 07:19.370
Let Mom and Dad know.

07:20.690 --> 07:21.210
Brother.

07:21.740 --> 07:22.660
Go get her.

07:23.690 --> 07:25.370
Smart move buying these.

07:25.570 --> 07:26.060
It's mine!

07:27.300 --> 07:30.100
Easy. Why are you pressing so hard?

07:30.100 --> 07:30.950
I'm taking your piece.

07:32.540 --> 07:33.740
When you play on my board,

07:33.740 --> 07:34.890
you press harder than that.

07:34.890 --> 07:36.250
Your board? What board is that?

07:36.250 --> 07:37.450
Can it compare to mine?

07:37.450 --> 07:39.660
This is a sandalwood chessboard.

07:39.737 --> 07:40.620
Sandalwood, you know?

07:40.740 --> 07:42.180
It just sounds premium.

07:43.810 --> 07:44.890
Fine, I'll be gentler.

07:47.010 --> 07:47.500
Fei,

07:48.060 --> 07:49.770
before the others get here,

07:49.810 --> 07:50.860
let me ask you something.

07:52.420 --> 07:54.130
When Fei Ni got married,

07:54.450 --> 07:55.940
why wasn't there a wedding?

07:56.660 --> 07:58.690
If she'd married Ye Feng,

07:59.690 --> 08:01.570
there would've been a banquet, right?

08:02.271 --> 08:03.980
Liu, that's the problem with you.

08:03.980 --> 08:05.093
You're too materialistic.

08:05.450 --> 08:07.370
What matters most in a marriage?

08:07.420 --> 08:09.060
The person you're marrying.

08:09.450 --> 08:11.450
Can Ye Feng compare to Fang?

08:11.450 --> 08:13.370
Fang is a hero.

08:14.210 --> 08:15.570
No offense,

08:16.570 --> 08:18.370
but you're muddleheaded at chess,

08:18.370 --> 08:20.426
and just as muddleheaded
picking a son-in-law.

08:21.180 --> 08:22.660
A title?

08:23.010 --> 08:24.570
What does that really prove?

08:28.620 --> 08:29.980
Has he dated anyone before?

08:31.330 --> 08:33.460
Did he get into trouble
in the countryside?

08:35.210 --> 08:36.610
Does he have a child?

08:37.450 --> 08:38.690
Do you know any of that?

08:44.940 --> 08:46.300
Of course I do.

08:47.450 --> 08:48.970
He was recognized by both

08:48.970 --> 08:51.900
the Educated Youth Office
and the factory administration.

08:52.060 --> 08:54.260
Wouldn't they know his background?

08:54.970 --> 08:57.690
The Educated Youth Office
won't be the one marrying him.

09:02.730 --> 09:03.610
Checkmate.

09:06.850 --> 09:07.450
I'm done.

09:07.450 --> 09:10.180
Come on, there are still moves left.

09:12.090 --> 09:14.490
No more chess today
because your son comes home?

09:15.660 --> 09:16.180
Honey.

09:16.780 --> 09:17.330
Honey.

09:17.690 --> 09:18.180
What is it?

09:18.180 --> 09:20.182
When I was playing chess
with Liu just now,

09:20.360 --> 09:21.900
he said something

09:22.080 --> 09:22.970
that got me thinking.

09:23.300 --> 09:25.050
Why do we trust Fang Muyang

09:25.050 --> 09:26.610
so wholeheartedly?

09:27.060 --> 09:28.380
What's not to trust?

09:28.420 --> 09:29.780
I think he's a good kid.

09:29.810 --> 09:30.300
He is.

09:30.640 --> 09:32.260
He does seem decent.

09:32.490 --> 09:34.310
But I can't help worrying.

09:34.690 --> 09:35.790
What if Fang Muyang

09:35.790 --> 09:37.900
is hiding something from us?

09:38.480 --> 09:40.900
He and Ni were classmates
in middle school,

09:40.900 --> 09:42.900
but they hadn't seen
each other for seven years.

09:43.020 --> 09:45.060
While he was
at the educated youth post,

09:45.060 --> 09:46.540
did he date anyone?

09:47.380 --> 09:48.970
Did he get into any trouble?

09:48.970 --> 09:50.450
We don't know.

09:51.982 --> 09:53.490
You're only thinking of this now?

09:53.690 --> 09:55.260
They've already registered.

09:55.290 --> 09:56.720
What's the point of second-guessing?

09:56.760 --> 09:59.204
Run all the way
to Great Northern Wilderness over this?

09:59.420 --> 10:00.582
I wouldn't go that far.

10:02.850 --> 10:04.300
Still,

10:04.970 --> 10:08.020
it's better to find out
than stay in the dark.

10:08.450 --> 10:09.300
Besides,

10:09.300 --> 10:11.420
what if something did happen?

10:15.420 --> 10:16.420
So what's your plan?

10:18.850 --> 10:20.570
I've got an idea.

10:20.900 --> 10:21.850
Hear me out.

10:23.720 --> 10:24.820
They say

10:25.071 --> 10:26.780
the truth comes out after a few drinks.

10:27.020 --> 10:28.900
Tonight, I'll bring some liquor

10:28.900 --> 10:30.970
and get Comrade Fang drunk.

10:30.970 --> 10:32.900
We'll see what he really has to say.

10:33.380 --> 10:35.450
When you men get drunk,
it's all nonsense.

10:35.450 --> 10:36.810
There's no "truth."

10:37.690 --> 10:41.020
If two out of ten
drunken ramblings are real, it's enough.

10:43.450 --> 10:45.260
Fine. Go ahead.

10:47.420 --> 10:48.850
We're out of liquor at home.

10:49.060 --> 10:50.260
Apply for a liquor coupon.

10:51.090 --> 10:53.180
So all that talk was
just an excuse to drink?

10:54.060 --> 10:55.020
No, no!

10:55.020 --> 10:57.450
You know

10:57.450 --> 10:59.450
I haven't been feeling well lately.

10:59.810 --> 11:01.260
The smell of alcohol makes me sick.

11:01.260 --> 11:02.260
I can barely stand it.

11:02.260 --> 11:03.690
I'm doing this for our daughter.

11:03.690 --> 11:05.180
I'm making a sacrifice here.

11:06.804 --> 11:07.690
How much do you need?

11:09.210 --> 11:11.420
The kid can't hold his liquor.

11:11.420 --> 11:12.690
100 to 150 mL at most.

11:13.140 --> 11:14.090
So, I'll get 500 mL.

11:14.450 --> 11:15.260
How much?

11:15.450 --> 11:16.260
500 mL liquor.

11:16.300 --> 11:16.900
500 mL?

11:16.900 --> 11:17.780
No, no...

11:17.780 --> 11:19.610
Better safe than sorry.

11:19.610 --> 11:20.810
What if he doesn't get drunk

11:20.810 --> 11:22.260
and nothing comes out?

11:22.260 --> 11:23.380
It'll all be for nothing.

11:23.850 --> 11:25.680
You can't catch a wolf without bait.

11:28.900 --> 11:29.350
Fine.

11:36.260 --> 11:39.420
I've heard of brothers
proposing for their sisters,

11:39.420 --> 11:41.330
but a sister proposing for her brother?

11:41.330 --> 11:42.850
That's a first for me.

11:43.490 --> 11:45.970
Mrs. Lin, I'm always
at your place anyway.

11:45.970 --> 11:46.970
I know it well.

11:47.190 --> 11:48.570
So I volunteered.

11:49.180 --> 11:51.410
Fei Ni, you're always welcome

11:51.410 --> 11:53.300
to visit us.

11:53.660 --> 11:56.090
But if you're here
to propose for your brother,

11:56.090 --> 11:58.690
don't expect me to smile about it.

11:58.690 --> 12:00.900
You know exactly what I'm like.

12:00.900 --> 12:03.180
I have a reputation for being picky.

12:03.570 --> 12:04.060
Mom,

12:04.500 --> 12:05.900
how can you say that?

12:05.900 --> 12:07.060
Because it's true.

12:07.210 --> 12:08.900
I like men with good education,

12:08.900 --> 12:11.260
steady jobs,
and preferably housing of their own.

12:12.020 --> 12:14.610
Fei Ting, which of those do you have?

12:14.610 --> 12:15.980
(Lin Mei's Father)

12:18.380 --> 12:19.490
He qualifies as "a man."

12:19.690 --> 12:21.180
And who isn't?

12:25.210 --> 12:26.570
Our Lin Mei

12:26.780 --> 12:28.490
may not be highly educated,

12:28.493 --> 12:30.660
but she works at
the Supply and Marketing Cooperative.

12:30.660 --> 12:31.970
The Cooperative!

12:32.020 --> 12:33.540
Do you know how many people

12:33.540 --> 12:34.900
can't even get in there?

12:35.380 --> 12:36.690
Look at all the things you bought.

12:36.690 --> 12:38.380
This pile of stuff

12:38.780 --> 12:41.570
was all purchased from the Cooperative.

12:41.570 --> 12:42.090
Right?

12:43.490 --> 12:46.090
Let me be honest with you.

12:46.300 --> 12:48.610
There's a young man from the bus station

12:48.610 --> 12:50.570
who's been pursuing our Lin Mei.

12:50.610 --> 12:52.970
He drives a passenger bus.

12:53.210 --> 12:54.660
You've heard the saying, right?

12:54.660 --> 12:56.210
Once you've got your hands on the wheel,

12:56.210 --> 12:58.020
you wouldn't trade it
for a county chief.

12:59.450 --> 13:01.900
Fei Ting,
where have you been assigned?

13:03.180 --> 13:05.090
Mrs. Lin, I just returned to the city.

13:05.260 --> 13:06.404
I haven't been assigned yet.

13:06.404 --> 13:08.160
So, is that no assignment yet,

13:08.160 --> 13:10.180
or no chance of getting one?

13:12.780 --> 13:14.970
Let me be clear today.

13:15.780 --> 13:17.420
You two are not a match.

13:17.420 --> 13:18.730
We don't approve.

13:18.730 --> 13:20.540
So give up on this idea.

13:20.540 --> 13:21.380
And take back

13:21.380 --> 13:22.330
all these gifts.

13:22.330 --> 13:24.420
You can use them
for your next blind date.

13:24.660 --> 13:25.420
Please, Mrs. Lin...

13:25.420 --> 13:25.940
Mom...

13:26.780 --> 13:28.610
Mrs. Lin, I don't think

13:29.020 --> 13:30.420
you're snobbish.

13:30.848 --> 13:32.210
I think you're just shortsighted.

13:33.310 --> 13:34.210
What do you mean?

13:34.730 --> 13:36.650
That young man from the bus station,

13:37.160 --> 13:38.420
his name is Chen Yunguo, right?

13:38.610 --> 13:39.150
That's right.

13:39.940 --> 13:41.010
To be honest,

13:41.490 --> 13:42.780
he wooed me too.

13:43.380 --> 13:44.730
So you see,

13:44.730 --> 13:45.870
aside from having a good job,

13:45.870 --> 13:46.690
he's slick-tongued,

13:46.970 --> 13:48.140
always on the road,

13:48.140 --> 13:49.610
traveling all over.

13:49.610 --> 13:50.940
Can you really be sure

13:50.940 --> 13:51.900
he'll settle down

13:51.900 --> 13:53.020
with Lin Mei?

13:56.090 --> 13:56.580
Yes,

13:56.940 --> 13:57.970
my brother

13:57.970 --> 13:59.970
hasn't secured a job yet.

14:00.090 --> 14:01.300
But he will.

14:01.570 --> 14:02.260
Look at him.

14:02.450 --> 14:03.060
He's steady,

14:03.200 --> 14:03.900
reliable,

14:04.010 --> 14:04.630
mature,

14:05.060 --> 14:06.140
responsible,

14:06.140 --> 14:07.140
and caring.

14:07.490 --> 14:09.900
Lin Mei would never suffer marrying him.

14:11.380 --> 14:12.490
And Mrs. Lin,

14:13.140 --> 14:14.420
everyone in our family,

14:14.420 --> 14:15.490
from top to bottom,

14:16.020 --> 14:17.140
adores Lin Mei.

14:17.330 --> 14:18.420
She'd be welcomed.

14:18.610 --> 14:21.020
We grew up together.

14:21.180 --> 14:22.690
If anyone ever dared bully her,

14:22.690 --> 14:24.970
I'd be the first to stand up for her.

14:29.330 --> 14:30.140
Yes.

14:31.330 --> 14:33.780
Our family isn't wealthy.

14:34.540 --> 14:35.610
But I promise you that

14:36.090 --> 14:37.420
whatever we have,

14:37.610 --> 14:38.610
she'll have too.

14:40.020 --> 14:40.810
Mrs. Lin,

14:41.380 --> 14:42.210
you can't judge

14:42.210 --> 14:43.970
just by how things look right now.

14:43.970 --> 14:45.690
That really would be shortsighted.

14:45.730 --> 14:47.330
Life is long.

14:47.970 --> 14:49.900
We have to think long-term.

14:50.380 --> 14:52.780
Who truly cares about Lin Mei,

14:53.210 --> 14:55.420
and who she genuinely wants to be with

14:55.420 --> 14:56.420
are what matter.

14:57.610 --> 14:59.780
Mom, Fei Ni's right.

15:01.180 --> 15:02.210
I love Fei Ting.

15:02.730 --> 15:03.810
I want to be with him.

15:07.210 --> 15:08.780
I hope you'll support me.

15:13.610 --> 15:15.210
Let's say, hypothetically,

15:15.610 --> 15:16.970
you do get married.

15:17.493 --> 15:18.300
Where will you live?

15:18.780 --> 15:19.900
And another thing,

15:20.300 --> 15:22.450
when will your job be settled?

15:23.540 --> 15:25.330
Mr. Lin, Mrs. Lin, here's the plan.

15:25.330 --> 15:26.400
After we marry, we'll live

15:26.400 --> 15:27.540
with my family in the factory

15:27.770 --> 15:28.880
housing compound.

15:29.250 --> 15:30.970
We'll have our own room.

15:30.970 --> 15:34.100
It's an apartment with washrooms
and toilets on each floor.

15:34.360 --> 15:35.180
As for work,

15:36.071 --> 15:37.537
I'll settle it as soon as possible.

15:40.940 --> 15:42.960
Then we'll talk after you've settled it.

15:43.210 --> 15:45.890
Fei Ni can talk all she wants,

15:46.140 --> 15:46.670
but

15:46.670 --> 15:49.020
no matter how beautifully you phrase it,

15:49.410 --> 15:50.500
I will not marry my daughter

15:50.500 --> 15:51.810
to an unemployed man.

15:52.493 --> 15:53.540
That's my bottom line.

15:54.480 --> 15:57.340
Mrs. Lin,
do you mean that once my brother

15:57.340 --> 15:58.330
has a job,

15:58.520 --> 15:59.890
you'll agree to the marriage?

16:01.200 --> 16:04.260
That depends on what kind of job it is.

16:09.330 --> 16:09.890
All right.

16:10.620 --> 16:11.210
I understand.

16:18.420 --> 16:19.680
(When our comrades
face difficulties,)

16:19.680 --> 16:21.248
(we must see our achievements,
see the light,)

16:21.271 --> 16:22.180
(and bolster our courage.)

16:26.810 --> 16:28.340
Dad, you're in a great mood today

16:28.570 --> 16:29.630
to have a drink with me.

16:29.630 --> 16:30.380
Let me.

16:32.330 --> 16:33.490
That's enough.

16:34.730 --> 16:36.900
Enough.

16:36.900 --> 16:37.970
That's good, Dad. Thanks.

16:39.260 --> 16:40.210
I can't hold my liquor.

16:41.970 --> 16:45.090
Afraid you'll say
something you shouldn't?

16:45.210 --> 16:46.180
No.

16:46.180 --> 16:48.420
Ask me anything. I'll tell you.

16:49.970 --> 16:50.510
Good.

16:50.910 --> 16:51.280
Cheers.

16:58.060 --> 16:59.540
Ni told me

17:00.260 --> 17:01.690
your memory's back.

17:02.330 --> 17:02.850
Yes.

17:03.900 --> 17:05.420
That's good. Very good. Cheers.

17:07.420 --> 17:10.180
You were sent down at seventeen.

17:10.880 --> 17:11.620
Yes.

17:19.770 --> 17:22.010
Stayed in Great Northern Wilderness
the whole time?

17:22.380 --> 17:23.530
Never transferred?

17:23.530 --> 17:24.940
Tell me about it.

17:25.290 --> 17:26.290
What was it like there?

17:26.970 --> 17:28.140
There's a lot to tell.

17:30.860 --> 17:31.530
Good, good.

17:31.530 --> 17:32.290
Come on,

17:32.290 --> 17:33.340
bottoms up.

17:43.380 --> 17:44.770
Start from the beginning.

17:44.770 --> 17:46.380
That first year

17:46.490 --> 17:48.250
at the Great Northern Wilderness
youth post,

17:48.340 --> 17:49.820
how many were there?

17:50.140 --> 17:51.010
How many men?

17:51.340 --> 17:52.290
How many women?

17:52.690 --> 17:53.620
The first year,

17:54.010 --> 17:56.210
we had eighteen in total.

17:56.210 --> 17:57.290
Twelve men,

17:57.970 --> 17:58.940
six women.

17:59.210 --> 18:00.420
What about the second year?

18:02.420 --> 18:03.970
A lot came in the second year.

18:04.340 --> 18:06.450
From Henan, Hebei,

18:06.710 --> 18:07.740
Shanxi, Shandong,

18:08.690 --> 18:11.940
Jiangsu, and Sichuan.

18:13.180 --> 18:14.530
How many from Hebei?

18:14.730 --> 18:17.420
Two men, four women.

18:18.620 --> 18:19.420
Shanxi?

18:19.770 --> 18:23.380
Six men, two women.

18:23.860 --> 18:24.530
Jiangsu?

18:24.530 --> 18:25.290
Jiangsu...

18:28.970 --> 18:29.770
Hubei.

18:30.620 --> 18:34.010
That's where your mother
and I got married.

18:36.100 --> 18:37.140
Did you know that?

18:37.770 --> 18:40.420
Back then, I was just

18:40.710 --> 18:42.450
a farm boy.

18:43.610 --> 18:45.490
The county's Peking Opera troupe

18:45.490 --> 18:47.260
came to the village scouting talent.

18:47.620 --> 18:50.210
Most people didn't dare go.

18:50.210 --> 18:51.530
They were afraid

18:51.860 --> 18:53.450
they'd lose their farmland.

18:53.870 --> 18:55.140
But not me.

18:55.680 --> 18:57.290
Your old man

18:57.580 --> 18:58.620
got good looks.

19:00.640 --> 19:02.750
I threw in a backflip,

19:03.250 --> 19:05.340
and they took me on the spot.

19:05.730 --> 19:09.620
The next year, the young
actresses in the troupe,

19:09.620 --> 19:11.620
at least eight or ten of them,

19:11.620 --> 19:13.010
had their eyes on me.

19:13.071 --> 19:15.970
The young lady, Xu Guihua, was a huadan.
[* A young female role in Peking Opera.]

19:16.820 --> 19:20.420
She was dressed in a green robe,
still dancing on stage.

19:20.420 --> 19:21.380
Luo Yufen.

19:24.140 --> 19:25.250
And there was also

19:25.450 --> 19:26.290
that...

19:26.860 --> 19:28.620
That pretty arts soldier.

19:28.940 --> 19:31.290
I think the surname was Lin.

19:32.290 --> 19:36.250
Well, a big forest
has all kinds of birds.

19:36.620 --> 19:37.970
Come on, another drink.

19:38.210 --> 19:40.290
Give it here, lightweight drinker.

19:42.690 --> 19:47.970
Tonight we drink
to celebrate our victory.

19:48.860 --> 19:49.450
Easy, easy.

19:49.450 --> 19:55.820
Until our ambitions are fulfilled,
we won't rest!

19:55.970 --> 19:57.770
We'll prove ourselves yet...

19:57.770 --> 19:58.380
Dad...

19:58.380 --> 19:59.090
Slow down.

20:00.190 --> 20:00.690
Careful.

20:00.690 --> 20:03.140
- We'll gladly shed our burning blood!
- Dad!

20:07.690 --> 20:09.530
I can't walk anymore.

20:09.690 --> 20:11.770
Let me lie down here for a bit.

20:12.210 --> 20:13.420
You head back first.

20:13.820 --> 20:15.580
I'll go home when I wake up.

20:17.820 --> 20:18.700
I'll stay with you.

20:26.210 --> 20:29.520
Fang, tell me the truth.

20:30.760 --> 20:32.250
In Great Northern Wilderness,

20:33.420 --> 20:34.940
were you ever married?

20:36.180 --> 20:38.010
Do you have a child?

20:39.380 --> 20:40.210
Dad,

20:40.770 --> 20:41.900
I promise you,

20:41.937 --> 20:43.448
back in Great Northern Wilderness,

20:43.530 --> 20:44.580
I was never married,

20:44.960 --> 20:46.010
and I have no children.

20:46.490 --> 20:47.690
Don't lie to me.

20:47.690 --> 20:48.860
You can't lie.

20:48.860 --> 20:49.620
I'm not.

20:51.730 --> 20:53.490
I promise you and Mom that

20:54.770 --> 20:55.730
Fei Ni

20:56.290 --> 20:57.820
is the only woman I'll ever love.

21:04.210 --> 21:05.730
Good.

21:07.290 --> 21:08.130
Fang.

21:08.450 --> 21:10.810
You are fortunate

21:11.180 --> 21:13.010
to have married Fei Ni.

21:13.340 --> 21:14.100
Understand?

21:14.900 --> 21:15.420
Yes.

21:15.730 --> 21:17.250
My daughter

21:17.730 --> 21:18.770
is very talented,

21:18.970 --> 21:19.940
beautiful,

21:21.010 --> 21:21.770
and kind.

21:24.210 --> 21:26.050
Such a wonderful girl.

21:32.140 --> 21:34.620
It's just that her father's no good.

21:35.420 --> 21:37.820
When other girls get married,

21:38.020 --> 21:39.730
they get the Four Big Items.

21:40.310 --> 21:41.770
The full set of furniture.

21:42.730 --> 21:43.970
And our Ni?

21:44.970 --> 21:46.100
Her new home

21:46.100 --> 21:48.270
barely has anything.

21:49.140 --> 21:51.530
Forget a proper wedding.

21:52.340 --> 21:54.180
I couldn't even

21:55.210 --> 21:56.580
put out some wedding candy.

21:59.490 --> 22:00.290
I know

22:02.100 --> 22:04.530
our Ni is sensible.

22:05.140 --> 22:07.140
She knows we don't have money.

22:07.140 --> 22:08.820
She didn't want us to spend it.

22:09.900 --> 22:11.770
But that's because her father

22:12.190 --> 22:14.010
isn't capable.

22:15.340 --> 22:16.530
Tell me,

22:16.660 --> 22:19.210
what kind of father am I?

22:20.940 --> 22:22.380
When it came to college,

22:22.380 --> 22:24.970
I couldn't help her much.

22:25.530 --> 22:28.380
When it came to housing,
I couldn't help either.

22:28.900 --> 22:31.180
I feel sorry for her!

22:36.690 --> 22:37.490
Dad,

22:38.940 --> 22:40.180
Fei Ni is lucky

22:40.180 --> 22:41.450
to be born into this family.

22:45.050 --> 22:46.420
You all love her so much.

22:47.290 --> 22:49.010
Can love put food on the table?

22:49.010 --> 22:49.830
Let me tell you,

22:49.830 --> 22:51.940
sometimes I regret it.

22:52.530 --> 22:54.000
If I had married

22:54.000 --> 22:56.190
Luo Yufen instead,

22:56.700 --> 22:58.850
would I be living like this now?

22:59.250 --> 23:00.770
Luo Yufen is now

23:00.770 --> 23:02.940
a leader in the cultural bureau.

23:03.690 --> 23:06.720
No, if I'd married Luo Yufen,

23:07.620 --> 23:09.480
there wouldn't be our Ni.

23:10.340 --> 23:11.940
No Fei Ting either.

23:11.940 --> 23:14.100
Not even Comrade Wu Baoying.

23:14.180 --> 23:14.940
No!

23:14.940 --> 23:16.690
I couldn't give them up.

23:17.010 --> 23:19.620
I want Fei Ting. I want Fei Ni.

23:19.620 --> 23:20.900
I want Wu Baoying.

23:22.620 --> 23:24.580
More booze...

23:43.010 --> 23:43.530
Fei.

23:45.900 --> 23:46.770
Wake up.

23:46.970 --> 23:48.530
Fang, let's drink.

23:48.770 --> 23:49.970
Still drinking?

23:50.690 --> 23:52.010
Fang?

23:52.290 --> 23:54.440
You were lying
on his lap for four hours.

23:54.440 --> 23:55.200
Do you know that?

23:55.900 --> 23:57.360
Fei Ting searched everywhere for you

23:57.360 --> 23:58.530
before carrying you home.

24:00.010 --> 24:00.720
Fei Ting!

24:01.290 --> 24:02.940
My son's back.

24:04.380 --> 24:04.980
Well?

24:07.730 --> 24:09.140
How did the proposal go?

24:10.140 --> 24:11.580
Pretty smoothly.

24:12.340 --> 24:14.690
Mom said you were going
to get Fang Muyang drunk.

24:15.010 --> 24:16.420
How did you end up drunk instead?

24:16.940 --> 24:18.770
You clearly don't understand drinking.

24:19.620 --> 24:21.080
If I didn't get drunk,

24:21.350 --> 24:22.900
how was I supposed to get him drunk?

24:23.290 --> 24:24.340
That's called,

24:24.340 --> 24:29.620
"Nothing ventured, nothing gained."

24:29.620 --> 24:30.690
Where's my shoe?

24:32.900 --> 24:34.180
Why is one missing?

24:34.180 --> 24:35.380
Where's my shoe?

24:36.690 --> 24:37.580
Go look for it.

24:37.580 --> 24:38.420
My shoe!

24:38.420 --> 24:39.620
Where'd it go?

24:39.620 --> 24:40.380
Oh no, Dad.

24:40.660 --> 24:43.420
It might have fallen off
when I carried you back.

24:43.770 --> 24:45.140
Go find it!

24:45.140 --> 24:46.290
Look carefully!

24:48.071 --> 24:49.180
Can't you do anything right?

24:49.180 --> 24:50.210
Anything at all?

24:51.770 --> 24:52.940
So you "ventured" with him,

24:53.004 --> 24:54.010
where's the result?

24:54.380 --> 24:55.620
What did you find out?

24:57.420 --> 24:58.340
Fang

24:58.860 --> 24:59.820
is a good kid.

25:04.620 --> 25:05.010
That's it?

25:05.380 --> 25:06.100
Yep.

25:06.970 --> 25:07.900
Fei Mingde!

25:08.290 --> 25:09.100
After eight hours

25:09.100 --> 25:09.940
and all that liquor,

25:09.940 --> 25:11.140
and that's all you got?

25:12.210 --> 25:14.580
What more do you want to hear?

25:15.490 --> 25:17.820
No news is the best news.

25:17.820 --> 25:19.290
Would you rather I tell you

25:19.290 --> 25:21.490
he's got a wife
in Great Northern Wilderness

25:21.490 --> 25:22.770
and two illegitimate kids?

25:23.010 --> 25:24.140
Would that make you happy?

25:27.530 --> 25:28.500
Honey.

25:28.760 --> 25:29.450
You stink.

25:29.450 --> 25:30.380
Go wash up.

25:31.620 --> 25:34.210
I only drank, didn't eat a thing.

25:34.290 --> 25:35.210
What's left at home?

25:35.210 --> 25:36.340
Make me a bite.

25:36.340 --> 25:37.490
All you think about is food.

26:24.970 --> 26:25.530
Dad.

26:26.210 --> 26:27.420
Xu Guihua,

26:28.390 --> 26:29.660
Luo Yufen,

26:30.340 --> 26:31.230
and that arts soldier

26:31.230 --> 26:32.620
you once knew,

26:32.620 --> 26:33.420
Ms. Lin...

26:34.182 --> 26:35.220
(Behind the photo frame)

26:35.220 --> 26:36.380
(are two liquor coupons)

26:36.520 --> 26:37.450
(and 8.5 yuan.)

26:37.826 --> 26:39.600
(Plus the meat coupon
you lost last month.)

26:39.900 --> 26:40.830
(I remember everything.)

26:41.180 --> 26:42.810
(We're on the same boat now.)

26:43.040 --> 26:44.870
(Put in a good word
for me with Mom.)

26:47.860 --> 26:49.040
Why did I blurt all that out?

26:54.620 --> 26:55.490
Still numb?

26:56.140 --> 26:56.660
Yeah.

26:57.490 --> 26:58.380
Can't feel it.

26:58.940 --> 27:00.820
You couldn't move his head?

27:01.450 --> 27:02.580
The ground was hard.

27:02.820 --> 27:03.940
How much did you two drink?

27:05.380 --> 27:06.770
More than 500 mL.

27:07.582 --> 27:09.093
Your dad had at least 450 mL.

27:09.770 --> 27:11.100
That much?

27:11.180 --> 27:11.810
Yeah.

27:13.140 --> 27:14.610
He told me every embarrassing thing

27:14.610 --> 27:15.620
you've done as a kid.

27:16.730 --> 27:17.770
What did he say?

27:18.380 --> 27:19.420
He said...

27:22.010 --> 27:23.530
He and your mom love you very much.

27:27.210 --> 27:28.730
Do you know how much I envy you?

27:29.620 --> 27:31.530
Envy me for what?

27:32.048 --> 27:34.020
For having a family
that loves you like this.

27:35.730 --> 27:37.010
Your mom may nag,

27:37.470 --> 27:39.820
but when it comes to you,
she worries the most.

27:40.620 --> 27:41.900
Your dad may seem unreliable,

27:42.870 --> 27:44.620
but once he's drunk,
all he talks about

27:44.900 --> 27:45.530
is you.

27:47.380 --> 27:48.490
And your brother too.

27:49.770 --> 27:51.180
I think I finally understand

27:52.690 --> 27:54.510
why I feel so at ease when I'm with you.

27:57.620 --> 27:58.800
You grew up

27:59.690 --> 28:01.090
showered with your family's love.

28:04.490 --> 28:05.420
I benefit from that too.

28:12.730 --> 28:13.180
Fei Ni,

28:15.820 --> 28:17.730
what's your dream wedding like?

28:21.290 --> 28:22.420
I've never thought about it.

28:22.970 --> 28:23.900
Then think about it now.

28:28.860 --> 28:30.180
Maybe...

28:31.210 --> 28:33.580
with my dad, my mom,
and my brother all there.

28:34.620 --> 28:37.290
We'll have it lively and warm.

30:30.690 --> 30:32.140
Why are you back so late?

30:34.900 --> 30:35.690
Sketching.

30:36.860 --> 30:38.620
You can sketch this late?

30:42.160 --> 30:43.490
Observing nocturnal animals.

30:44.250 --> 30:45.050
By the way, Fei Ni,

30:45.450 --> 30:46.560
can you knit a mesh bag?

30:47.350 --> 30:48.050
Sure.

30:48.450 --> 30:50.340
We're doing
still-life sketching next lesson.

30:50.360 --> 30:52.100
The perspective through a mesh is great.

30:52.490 --> 30:53.620
Can you make me one?

30:53.940 --> 30:54.900
The bigger the better.

30:55.860 --> 30:56.660
No problem.

30:58.420 --> 30:58.820
All right.

31:00.140 --> 31:01.420
I'll wash up.

31:09.900 --> 31:10.860
You're going out?

31:11.820 --> 31:12.930
To Jiangcheng.

31:13.920 --> 31:14.550
On business?

31:15.900 --> 31:17.340
My younger brother wrote.

31:17.660 --> 31:19.340
He invited me to his wedding.

31:21.737 --> 31:23.120
Do you want me to go with you?

31:25.900 --> 31:26.860
Do you want to?

31:28.900 --> 31:30.730
If you want me there, I'll go.

31:33.290 --> 31:34.290
Then don't.

31:35.660 --> 31:37.530
My brother's always been carefree,

31:37.690 --> 31:38.690
full of tricks.

31:39.140 --> 31:40.210
You wouldn't like him.

31:41.900 --> 31:43.340
At least in my opinion,

31:43.340 --> 31:44.626
he has one redeeming quality.

31:44.690 --> 31:45.490
What's that?

31:46.900 --> 31:47.690
He has a heart.

31:49.050 --> 31:50.490
At the very least,

31:50.490 --> 31:51.490
he invited you.

31:52.630 --> 31:53.860
So you're implying

31:54.900 --> 31:55.730
I don't have a heart?

31:56.140 --> 31:57.250
I didn't say that.

31:57.626 --> 32:00.093
If that's how you choose to take it,
I can't help that.

32:01.450 --> 32:02.530
Finish packing.

32:02.530 --> 32:03.530
I'm going to shower.

32:11.810 --> 32:12.970
All aboard!

32:13.120 --> 32:14.670
(Jiangnan)
The train to Jiangcheng

32:14.670 --> 32:15.830
is about to depart.

32:16.100 --> 32:17.450
Please get on quickly!

32:33.010 --> 32:33.820
Sorry, Comrade.

32:34.010 --> 32:34.730
It's fine.

33:25.730 --> 33:26.390
Sorry.

33:31.660 --> 33:32.730
What are you doing here?

33:33.620 --> 33:36.090
The person sitting here
got off at Yongxing.

33:37.620 --> 33:38.860
I've been here fifteen minutes.

33:39.140 --> 33:40.530
You didn't look up once.

33:41.340 --> 33:44.210
You're probably the most focused reader

33:44.620 --> 33:45.860
I've ever met.

33:46.420 --> 33:47.690
But I should mention that

33:47.860 --> 33:49.210
looking down at a book for too long

33:49.580 --> 33:50.620
isn't good

33:50.620 --> 33:51.420
for your neck.

33:53.620 --> 33:54.871
Liu, play a few hands for me.

33:54.915 --> 33:55.970
I'm going to the restroom.

33:55.970 --> 33:56.380
Okay.

34:03.900 --> 34:05.050
Where are you headed?

34:05.250 --> 34:06.050
Jiangcheng.

34:09.490 --> 34:10.490
Don't misunderstand.

34:10.493 --> 34:11.700
It has nothing to do with you.

34:13.300 --> 34:15.450
The hospital assigned me to Jiangcheng

34:15.450 --> 34:18.090
for a neurosurgery symposium.

34:21.450 --> 34:22.260
What a coincidence.

34:23.450 --> 34:23.900
Yes.

34:24.780 --> 34:25.860
Quite a coincidence.

34:29.960 --> 34:30.610
By the way...

34:32.610 --> 34:34.340
I happened to buy two sleeper tickets.

34:34.960 --> 34:36.900
(Hard sleeper)
Why don't you switch to a sleeper?

34:36.900 --> 34:38.115
If you get tired from reading,

34:38.420 --> 34:39.860
you can lie down and rest.

34:53.980 --> 34:56.860
(Hard sleeper ticket)

35:00.100 --> 35:06.420
(China Science)

35:27.782 --> 35:29.180
(Introduction to Higher Mathematics)

35:40.940 --> 35:42.740
If you want to attend
Fang Muyang's wedding,

35:43.130 --> 35:44.450
I can take you with me.

35:46.700 --> 35:47.860
I'm not interested.

35:48.420 --> 35:49.450
Don't misunderstand.

35:49.610 --> 35:50.940
I didn't come to Jiangcheng

35:50.940 --> 35:52.050
because of you.

35:52.490 --> 35:53.490
I told you,

35:53.820 --> 35:55.300
I'm here on business.

35:55.700 --> 35:57.010
Of course I don't misunderstand.

35:58.130 --> 35:59.130
It just so happens

35:59.130 --> 36:01.300
your hospital sent you to Jiangcheng,

36:01.860 --> 36:03.940
you happened to book
the same train as me,

36:04.260 --> 36:06.300
and happened to run into me on board.

36:06.900 --> 36:08.340
Pure coincidence.

36:12.130 --> 36:14.340
I'm glad you see it that way.

36:14.860 --> 36:16.490
Once we reach Jiangcheng,

36:16.490 --> 36:17.582
we'll mind our own business.

36:18.490 --> 36:19.340
Sure.

37:04.010 --> 37:04.780
Comrade,

37:04.826 --> 37:06.900
could you not spit
sunflower shells everywhere?

37:07.130 --> 37:07.820
What?

37:08.340 --> 37:09.050
Did it hit you?

37:19.940 --> 37:21.490
Please put your feet down.

37:21.740 --> 37:24.220
My legs are this long.
I need the leg room.

37:35.700 --> 37:36.490
I'm a doctor.

37:36.490 --> 37:37.870
I can arrange an amputation.

37:38.360 --> 37:39.220
What's your problem?

37:39.900 --> 37:41.610
If you can't crack seeds properly,

37:41.610 --> 37:43.050
I'll stitch your mouth shut.

37:44.700 --> 37:45.700
Who are you?

37:46.010 --> 37:46.820
What's it to you?

37:52.740 --> 37:53.820
I'm her husband.

37:54.010 --> 37:55.260
Does that give me the right?

37:55.260 --> 37:56.180
(Marriage Certificate)

38:04.490 --> 38:05.450
If I put my feet down,

38:05.450 --> 38:06.220
would you like it?

38:06.280 --> 38:08.400
What's wrong with you?
Have some manners.

38:10.340 --> 38:11.130
Fine.

38:11.650 --> 38:12.450
I'll stop eating.

38:13.340 --> 38:14.420
Happy now?

38:30.090 --> 38:30.900
Take my berth.

39:49.782 --> 39:50.640
What are you doing?

39:51.048 --> 39:52.048
What's going on here?

39:52.650 --> 39:53.740
Comrade!

39:54.915 --> 39:56.310
Are you sneaking around fishing?

39:57.490 --> 39:58.780
No, no.

39:58.780 --> 40:00.090
I was...

40:00.090 --> 40:01.130
I was picking up trash.

40:01.337 --> 40:02.982
There's so much litter on the bank.

40:06.490 --> 40:07.940
You've got good awareness, young man.

40:08.450 --> 40:09.740
All right, it's pitch dark.

40:09.900 --> 40:10.610
Head back early.

40:10.940 --> 40:11.450
Yes.

40:11.693 --> 40:13.340
Don't forget to take the trash with you.

40:13.600 --> 40:14.060
Of course.

40:14.490 --> 40:15.000
Let's go.

40:21.090 --> 40:21.940
Move it.

40:22.300 --> 40:23.650
Coming, coming.

40:24.900 --> 40:25.490
Hurry up.

40:47.820 --> 40:50.460
(Ten yuan, One yuan)

40:53.700 --> 40:55.490
(I took the money without telling her.)

40:56.130 --> 40:57.380
(Was that too much?)

41:07.650 --> 41:10.130
(Forget a proper wedding.)

41:10.130 --> 41:12.010
(I couldn't even)

41:12.260 --> 41:13.530
(put out some wedding candy.)

41:14.450 --> 41:15.900
(I love this family so much.)

41:16.220 --> 41:17.700
(So much.)

41:18.300 --> 41:19.740
(Maybe...)

41:19.740 --> 41:22.220
(with my dad, my mom,
and my brother all there.)

41:22.700 --> 41:23.740
(We'll have it)

41:24.570 --> 41:25.420
(lively and warm.)

41:25.650 --> 41:26.220
(Fei Ni.)

41:27.130 --> 41:27.780
(I promise)

41:28.226 --> 41:29.280
(I'll pay you back soon.)

41:31.610 --> 41:32.420
Fang Muyang.

41:34.610 --> 41:36.010
What's so secretive?

41:36.010 --> 41:36.940
Can't we talk at home?

41:37.004 --> 41:37.610
Brother-in-law.

41:38.450 --> 41:40.937
Fei Ni told me that back
in Great Northern Wilderness,

41:41.048 --> 41:41.940
you fed the whole post

41:41.940 --> 41:43.130
with just one big iron pot.

41:43.130 --> 41:44.050
Is that true?

41:44.220 --> 41:45.340
Of course it's true.

41:45.490 --> 41:46.610
Let me put it this way.

41:46.610 --> 41:47.300
Whatever flies,

41:47.300 --> 41:47.900
runs,

41:47.900 --> 41:49.130
swims, or hops in the grass,

41:49.300 --> 41:50.340
if it's edible,

41:50.340 --> 41:51.860
I can stew it in one pot.

41:52.010 --> 41:53.260
Then, I've found the right man.

41:53.940 --> 41:55.260
So, Brother-in-law,

41:55.450 --> 41:57.010
care to help

41:57.220 --> 41:58.380
with your sister's wedding?

41:59.490 --> 42:00.340
The wedding?

42:03.100 --> 42:07.180
(The masses have boundless creativity.)

42:11.450 --> 42:13.650
(Xiangyang Road)
Bus No. 4 to Worker-Peasant Hospital.

42:15.380 --> 42:15.970
What about you?

42:16.380 --> 42:17.340
I'll head east.

42:18.970 --> 42:20.300
Be careful on the way.

42:32.340 --> 42:39.220
(Jiangcheng No. 2 Guesthouse)

42:50.848 --> 42:52.160
What are you doing here?

42:54.380 --> 42:55.130
What a coincidence.

42:58.610 --> 43:00.650
The guesthouses
near the hospital are full.

43:00.650 --> 43:01.420
So...

43:05.848 --> 43:07.420
It's your brother's wedding tomorrow.

43:07.420 --> 43:09.780
Shouldn't you prepare
something for him?

43:10.170 --> 43:10.610
No.

43:11.300 --> 43:13.010
I don't even plan to tell him I'm here.

43:14.050 --> 43:14.860
Why?

43:28.860 --> 43:33.340
♪After the laughter, I think of you♪

43:35.900 --> 43:40.620
♪After the storm, I think of you♪

43:43.140 --> 43:49.260
♪In the little courtyard,
there you are dancing♪

43:50.260 --> 43:54.820
♪That earnest you,
smiling so innocently♪

43:57.300 --> 44:02.060
♪In spring, I stay by your side♪

44:04.500 --> 44:08.860
♪When summer comes, I watch over you♪

44:11.220 --> 44:17.860
♪In the light of dawn, you belong to me♪

44:17.860 --> 44:27.460
♪At the edge of the world,
I will still hold you tight♪

44:28.540 --> 44:34.700
♪There is a small place♪

44:34.700 --> 44:41.500
♪Where they carry big dreams♪

44:41.500 --> 44:48.860
♪Every lovely face♪

44:49.740 --> 44:55.900
♪Shines brightly in the heart♪

44:56.700 --> 45:02.740
♪Even when we collide,
we hold our course♪

45:03.940 --> 45:09.740
♪Even when we stumble,
we keep our resolve♪

45:10.820 --> 45:17.100
♪My you, walking toward the distance♪

45:17.900 --> 45:26.140
♪Please carry our dreams
and let them soar♪
